	(gr_text "KOGUMA MK4 main board for tire 24mm (t24): outline t24v12 (mechanical/pcb/pcb_outline_t24v12.dxf), 0.6mm. Fixed by mechanics: J5/J6 encoder pads, D70-D77 wall sensor holders (bottom), D90-D96 UI LEDs (1608, same assignment as ToraNeko.Mk3), D98 front LED, H1-H4 M2 posts. Others: not placed yet"
